WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:09.000
MileInvestiga applies more than twenty artificial intelligence models to the evidence, in under two seconds.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:20.000
Faces, plates and scenes identified in real time. Voice transcribed and translated. Text analyzed with natural language processing.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:30.000
The criminal network graph is revealed with centrality analysis, and spatio-temporal patterns show who operates, where and how often.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:40.000
AlejoGeo georeferences everything and cross-references it with open sources and the client's own data. The human analyst interprets the result with judgment.
